<title>UK: SOCCER-NEWCASTLE UNITED 0 MONACO 1 RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEWCASTLE UNITED 0 MONACO 1 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEWCASTLE, England 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monaco of the French league beat Newcastle United of England 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their UEFA cup quarter-final first leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Sonny Anderson 59</p>
<p>Attendance: 36,215</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Newcastle: 15-Shaka Hislop; 19-Steve Watson, 5-Darren Peacock, 12-Phillipe Albert, 21-Robbie Elliott, 18-Keith Gillespie, 4-David Batty, 2-Warren Barton, 20-Lee Clark, 24- David Ginola, 7-Robert Lee</p>
<p>Monaco: 1-Fabien Barthez; 19-Lilian Martin, 5-Franck Dumas, 18-Gilles Grimandi, 2-Patrick Blondeau, 4-Martin Djetou, 15-Sylvain Legwinski, 7-John Collins, 8-Ali Benarbia, 9-Sonny Anderson, 28-Thierry Henry (24-Victor Ikpeba 79)</p>
</text>
